@host = http://localhost:5044

### List
GET {{host}}/api/warehouses

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "North Depot", "location": "Aarhus" }

### Duplicate name, expect 409
POST {{host}}/api/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "North Depot", "location": "Aarhus" }

### Update
PUT {{host}}/api/warehouses/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "North Depot", "location": "Aarhus East", "isActive": true }